text = "[center][color=#66BB6A][font_size=32][b]Mycelium Underground Village[/b][/font_size][/color]

[color=#A5D6A7][font_size=22][b]Green Building for the Future[/b][/font_size][/color][/center]

Welcome to the Mycelium Underground Village (M.U.V.) Project, a futuristic approach to building, using plant matter to grow into a brighter tomorrow!

Mushroom bricks are the foundation of our village, using nature’s materials as bricks for our answer to polluting building materials that release Greenhouse Gases during manufacturing.

[center][color=#81C784][font_size=18][b]The future is here, and it’s green![/b][/font_size][/color]


[color=#A5D6A7][font_size=22][b]Founder Theo Donovan[/b][/font_size][/color][/center]

This project was dreamt up in a lab where Dr. Theo Donovan decided he would take the miracle fungus material and use it to build a village like no other!

Careful study for making sturdy materials that weather any storm led to the local government greenlighting Dr. Donovan’s work.

Dr. Donovan was one of the first village inhabitants and lives here still!


[center][color=#A5D6A7][font_size=22][b]From Mycellium Underground Village to the World![/b][/font_size][/color][/center]

Dr. Donovan’s dream is to spread the use of mushrooms for building materials to the world. Buy your property now, and be a part of the future!

Buildings are affordable, equipped with all the modern features you desire, and soon perhaps even possessing a mycellium based intranet!


[center][color=#66BB6A][font_size=24][b]Be the pioneer! Buy your lot and grow the mushroom movement![/b][/font_size][/color][/center]"
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1

